                  "platformdirs/unix.py: _site_data_dirs/_site_config_dirs build with create=False; site_applications_dir uses _select_and_create; _iter_config_dirs/_iter_data_dirs now create each site path lazily at yield time instead of relying on eager list construction.",
                  "platformdirs/macos.py: _base_site_dirs/_site_cache_dirs build with create=False; site_cache_dir/site_applications_dir use _select_and_create; site_state_dir explicitly creates only the single selected entry; _iter_config_dirs/_iter_data_dirs/_iter_cache_dirs create lazily per yielded path.",
                  "Manually traced public_check.py scenario: Unix('demo', ensure_exists=True).site_data_dir with XDG_DATA_DIRS='/q3/first:/q3/second' and multipath=False -> _site_data_dirs returns ['/q3/first/demo','/q3/second/demo'] uncreated, _select_and_create creates only '/q3/first/demo' and returns it, matching the asserted value and created list."
